  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/yYXNKdtq/minecraft-title.png\" alt=\"標題\"></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252f2dwisp.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Bluesky-追蹤-448DEE?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=bluesky&amp;logoColor=white&amp;labelColor=454545\" alt=\"Bluesky\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252f2DWisp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/X(推特)-追蹤-1A1A1A?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white&amp;labelColor=454545\" alt=\"X(推特)\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@2dwisp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/youtube/channel/subscribers/UCXzb8erNlBkcd6VmE4JWj2A?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;label=YouTube&amp;labelColor=454545&amp;color=E52D27&amp;link=https://www.youtube.com/@2dwisp\" alt=\"YouTube訂閱數\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252f2dwisp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Ko--fi-贊助-FF5E5B?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=ko-fi&amp;logoColor=white&amp;labelColor=454545\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsimple-grass-flowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/simple-grass-flowers?style=for-the-badge&amp;label=Modrinth&amp;logo=Modrinth&amp;logoColor=white&amp;labelColor=454545&amp;color=00AF5C\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/simple-grass-flowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/551206?style=for-the-badge&amp;label=CurseForge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white&amp;labelColor=454545&amp;color=F1641E\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a></p><h2>🌻 介紹：</h2><p>為草地、灰壤和菌絲體方塊添加花朵、岩石、三葉草等符合原版風格的細節。</p><p>無需安裝任何模組。</p><p>若想讓草方塊側面變矮，可同時安裝我的另一個資源包 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsimple-lower-grass-sides\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">簡約矮草側面</a>！</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbare-bones-grass-flowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">如需兼容Bare Bones的版本，請安裝此資源包。</a></p><h2>🎨 我的所有作品：</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fartisanal-default\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wisp的重製原版材質</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fwisps-colourful-wildflowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wisp的繽紛野花</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsimple-grass-flowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">簡約草地花朵</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbare-bones-grass-flowers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bare Bones草地花朵</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsimple-lower-grass-sides\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">簡約矮草側面</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ffancy-full-block-grass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">精緻全草方塊</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fartisanal-nether-bricks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">匠心地獄磚塊</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fsimple-rustic-glass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">簡約復古玻璃</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fraven-phantoms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">烏鴉幻翼</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbetter-breeze-rod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">改良微風法杖</a></li>\n</ul><h2>🤔 常見問題：</h2><p><strong>問：如何安裝此資源包？</strong><br>\n答：請參考<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fblog%252fhow-to-install-minecraft-texture-packs-4615399%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">本指南</a>。</p><p><strong>問：會推出基岩版嗎？</strong><br>\n答：目前沒有移植基岩版的計畫。</p><p><strong>問：可以讓其他人移植到基岩版嗎？</strong><br>\n答：不行，我不允許第三方移植我的資源包。</p><p><strong>問：能新增某個功能嗎？</strong><br>\n答：或許可以！歡迎留言建議。</p><p><strong>問：我發現錯誤！</strong><br>\n答：請留言回報，我會盡快修復。</p><p><strong>問：支援某版本嗎？</strong><br>\n答：經測試可兼容至<strong>1.15版</strong>。由於檔案名稱變更，更早版本可能無法運作。</p><p><strong>問：能加入我的模組包嗎？</strong><br>\n答：當然！但需標註出處且不得宣稱為自己的作品。</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fjamie\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/7c463234-3d14-4a86-9788-f3a6d45a2488.png\" alt=\"Bisect Hosting\"></a></p>",
